{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Jigsaws is a puzzle game where you solve strange jigsaws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve around 50 or so strange jigsaws, each with their own surprising way of being solved. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore unusual puzzle worlds themed after jigsaws. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enter the Jigsawverse, maybe. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a spiritual sequel to my game &quot;20 Small Mazes&quot;, but it's a little bit harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I recommend playing the game using keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes on puzzle accessibility: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is color-blind friendly. There are two puzzles that use color and they both have a &quot;colorblind mode&quot; toggle on the puzzle itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game has accessibility options for hard of hearing or deaf people. There are three separate track of subtitles: background music, sound effects, and voices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Some puzzles require knowledge of English. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Strange Jigsaws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2702170/acae725cf6aada4ce1bd79562838c51ab5cde3b5.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Jigsaws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2702170/6a02fa01f9f4aeff8d69e94686b49acffbd1355e.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Jigsaws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2702170/fc51caf90e9f17983f6e148f9999ade44530bbc4.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Jigsaws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2702170/071e952193ae939761d8ede61749924f924e0aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Jigsaws","path":